ing or Cleaning Bodily Fluids (26 TAC §746.3415(7))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3301-f-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520","date":"2025-05-20","original_code":"746.3301(f)(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-05-27","finding":"Nutrition and Food Service - Drinking water available at every snack, mealtime, and during and after active play: Children did not initially have water outside and had to wait for it to be brought out. Additionally, only one child had water available to them during snack..","topic":"food","source_record_id":"1026517947","violation_type_title":"Nutrition and Food Service - Drinking water available at every snack, mealtime, and during and after active play (26 TAC §746.3301(f)(1))","topic_label":"Food & nutrition"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3309-c","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520","date":"2025-05-20","original_code":"746.3309(c)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-05-27","finding":"Parent Provided Meals/Snacks - Provide Safe Storage and Service: A frozen meal was left out on a counter top for at least an hour and twenty five minutes before it was cooked and served to a child in care. The box states to keep frozen and do not thaw. Additionally, one child was served pizza that had been sitting out on the counter for the same amount of time.","topic":"food","source_record_id":"1026477452","violation_type_title":"Parent Provided Meals/Snacks - Provide Safe Storage and Service (26 TAC §746.3309(c))","topic_label":"Food & nutrition"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1494042-i20250520","date":"2025-05-20","original_code":"746.1701","severity":"medium","severity_label